      },
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "Failed jobs, all repos",
      "description": "Failed or timed-out jobs in every repo teleometer is installed on. Their log tails are kind=\"log\" lines with the same job_id.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 17
